comment_regular_data.body:
Glad I could be of some small help. 

Congratulations should be attributed to @sghng, the OP of `41711`. I could not follow the logic by myself since I don't know any C and never really delved deep into Neovim codebase. His analytical report helped me discern the flow of what's happening and even then I was not 100% certain.

I tried `41958` locally and it does solve both the problem of `41711` and my old question which is also mentioned in that issue.

However it does not solve the problem of this PR I think yet. I tried with a minimal repro taken from the test of this PR 
```lua
vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd("VimEnter", {
	callback = function()
		if vim.v.startreason == "restart" then
			-- Simulate a plugin loading session buffers before :edit enters them.
			vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd("BufAdd", {
				callback = function(ev)
					vim.fn.bufload(ev.buf)
				end,
			})
		end
	end,
})
```
and `:restart` doesn't work correctly for the case that this PR tries to solve. I think the 2 are not related, but I might as well be wrong, so I'll just leave it up to the more knowledgeable Neovim team. Just thought I'd mention this since `41958` mentions that it also fixes the case of this PR, which I don't think it's the case.
